    <div class="multi-p">
        <div class="p"><b><i>Evasive Flight.</i></b> If the fly is subjected to an effect that allows it to make a Dexterity saving throw to take only half damage, it instead takes no damage if it succeeds on the saving throw, and only half damage if it fails. It must be <a href="/rules/2d/glossary/movement.html#flying">flying</a> and not <a href="/rules/2d/glossary/conditions.html#incapacitated">incapacitated</a> to gain this benefit.</div>
    </div>
