        <div class="p"><b><i>(2 AP) Glow.</i></b> The firefly lights up, shedding <span class="popupAnchor" data-injection-arg="environment#light.subitems.dim" onclick='handleAnchorClick("environment#light.subitems.dim", this, event)' onmouseover='showPopup("environment#light.subitems.dim", this, event)' onmouseout='hidePopup("environment#light.subitems.dim", event)'>dim light</span> (1 ft.) until the start of its next turn.</div>
